  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop or crush garlic. In a medium saucepan, melt 1/2 the butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat.\n• Cook garlic until fragrant, 1-2 mins. Add jasmine rice, the water and a generous  pinch of salt and bring to the boil. Reduce heat to low and cover with a lid. Cook for 12 mins, then remove from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and the water is absorbed, 12 mins.\n• Meanwhile, grate carrot. Slice zucchini into half-moons. Drain and rinse kidney beans.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6571674938e51a4a51a2ff87-3057aa33.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook carrot and zucchini until tender, 2-3 mins. Cook kidney beans until tender, 2-3 mins. Add jerk seasoning and cook until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Stir in coconut milk and vegetable stock powder, cook until slightly thickened, 2-3 mins. Remove from heat. Stir in remaining butter until melted.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6571674938e51a4a51a2ff87-f707ad14.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop tomato and coriander. Roughly chop cucumber.\n• In a bowl, combine tomato, cucumber, coriander, and a drizzle of olive oil and white wine vinegar.\n• Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6571674938e51a4a51a2ff87-b496e04d.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide garlic rice between bowls.\n• Top with kidney beans and salsa.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6571674938e51a4a51a2ff87-d235d882.jpeg"
    }
  ]
